# D3-CO-003: An oil layer is not a dissolved organic molecule
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 ethanol 2g
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 vegetable_oil 2g
stir v1 300rpm 10s
stir v2 300rpm 10s
look v1
look v2
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
wait 5min
look v2
inspect
